        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cybersoul, where Multiplayer,  Deckbuilding, Card Games, Auto Battlers, and a compulsive Dark Web, Souls &amp; Star Power incremental idle system collide in a flash of neon. Jack into the ultimate Cyberpunk Card Battler, launching with 33+ dystopian Factions and over 1,200 cards. Battle 33 Heroes. Defeat your Friends. Go dark, play Solo offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compiled in the static of a dying world, <strong>Cybersoul </strong>takes the card battlers you know and hard-wires them into a high-tech, low-life future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras/e5ff8747255e083bc33a2efb77170e3f.avif?t=1787776465\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras_big/e5ff8747255e083bc33a2efb77170e3f.avif?t=1787776465 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game Modes: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid Boss: </strong>Solo PvE vs a 99 HP triple-power boss. Bring your deck. Claim the kill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Brawl: </strong>Classic combat with a random rule twist every game. Never the same fight twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft Arena: </strong>Draft your Hero Power and 30 cards, then duel solo or via Steam PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battle: </strong>Buy, build, FIGHT. Auto-combat army battles with unique rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joker Poker: </strong>Roguelike Poker. Blinds, Jokers, Upgrades, Cybercoin bets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gauntlet</strong>: Play as a 99 HP triple-power boss. Collect stat boosting relics. Win as many escalating fights as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bet:</strong> Stake Credits on AI vs AI battles. Pick a side, wins pay double. Spot the rig.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras/2ccf36c90a1c0f20883fc6e3ff7ba675.avif?t=1787776465\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras_big/2ccf36c90a1c0f20883fc6e3ff7ba675.avif?t=1787776465 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the scrap-metal juggernauts of the <strong>Rust Legion</strong>, the chemical-fueled speedsters of the <strong>Stim Freaks</strong>, and the corporate overlords of the <strong>Credit Barons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Battle Heroes:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Dynasty, Silicon Priesthood, Riot Squad. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Market, Helix Vats, Media Moguls. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chrono Drifters, Circuit Mystics, The Transhacks. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Spacers, Sonic Hedons, The Transcended. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaia Overgrowth, Mad Motors, Cortex Collective. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roller Ballers, Idol Proxies, Vandal Krew. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xeno Preserve, Moon Marines, Offworld Miners. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiation Zone, Black Ops, House of Love.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Synchronicities, Deep Sea Horrors, Cosmic Abominations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Vamps, Digital Zombies, Mecha Beasts.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras/cf79a8de1f35b01907630ab030e31207.avif?t=1787776465\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras_big/cf79a8de1f35b01907630ab030e31207.avif?t=1787776465 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>1,200 distinctive cards</strong>, each surging with cybernetic augmentations and system-breaking hacks, the tactical possibilities are limitless. But the Grid is unforgiving. Engage in visceral, turn-based combat against a ruthless AI that learns your exploits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you need to disconnect from the warfare, the <strong>Glitch Arcade</strong> awaits! Gamble your life away and earn Credits &amp; Energy in corrupted <strong>Casino</strong> simulations of classics like <strong>9-Player Poker, Blackjack, Pool, Match 3, Chess, Space Invaders, Brick Break, Snooker, </strong>and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse </strong>the<strong> Living Archive (Lore):</strong> Decrypt faction dossiers, corrupted myths, and world transmissions from a Grid that forgot its own history. Follow every link. The archive never finishes writing itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, set your system to <strong>idle farm  Dark Web, Soul Coins &amp; Star Power </strong>incrementals<strong>.</strong> Spend your ill-gotten credits to build your digital empire, upgrade your rig, overclock your cards, and farm resources even while you sleep. 🔋</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYSTEM FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>33+ Dystopian Factions:</strong> Master the streets—from the brute force of the <strong>Moon Marines</strong>  to the arcane code of the <strong>Chrono Drifters </strong>and the corrupted <strong>Media Moguls</strong>. <strong>Battle 33 merciless Heroes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,200+ Cybersoul Cards:</strong> Compile a deck of cybernetic horrors, viruses, traps, and glitches, each rendered in a visceral analog-horror art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Roguelite Game Modes: <i>Chaos Brawl,</i></strong> adapt to a random rule twist. <i><strong>Arena,</strong></i> draft the best deck you can from random card offers.  <i><strong>Raid Boss,</strong> </i>defeat a 99 HP triple hero power boss. <i><strong>Joker Poker,</strong></i> Roguelike Poker. <i><strong>Auto Battle,</strong></i> buy, build, FIGHT. Auto-combat army battles. <strong><i>Gauntlet,</i></strong> boss-fight run with extra hero powers and relic picks. <i><strong>Bet,</strong></i> stake Credits on AI vs AI, pick a side, win pays 2×</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Test your skills, craft the strongest decks. Become the best. Get rewarded. Achieve glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Friends:</strong> Who will be the ultimate 1v1 cyber champion?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore Bible:</strong> Open the living archive—33 faction dossiers, myths, and neon-soaked world docs. Read deep. Trust nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neural-Net AI Battles:</strong> Test your build against adaptive AI opponents that exploit your weaknesses and show no mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Fast, brutal, and strategic. Execute combos that shatter the game logic and overload your opponent’s CPU.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Deck Optimization:</strong> Tailor your loadout with a diverse host of mechs, mutants, and programs. Unlock encrypted data packs to find rare, holographic foils.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Glitch Arcade Casino:</strong> Hustle for Credits &amp; Energy in hacked versions of Poker, Pool, Blackjack, Snooker, Chess, and Retro Arcade shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Web, Souls &amp; Star Power Idle Games:</strong> Grow your influence and harvest resources from the Mainframe through an expansive idle system. Your wealth grows while you sleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acid-Graphic Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world of hyper-stylized &quot;Analog-Glitch&quot; art, neon-soaked environments, and geometric brutalism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Hour Industrial Soundtrack:</strong> Lose your mind to over 60 hours of pounding Synthwave, Dark Techno, and Industrial noise designed to keep your heart rate critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>819 Corrupted Voiceline Data Logs:</strong> Absorb cryptic truths and proverb-packed lore files from a world that has forgotten its own history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Login Rewards:</strong> Jack in daily to receive a supply drop of Credits, XP, and Energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Challenges: </strong>Earn card packs by winning battles as the current Challenger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New User Protocol:</strong> Learn the systems with interactive popup tutorials, making it easy for fresh meat and veteran hackers to upload their consciousness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Mode:</strong> Hone your skills solo against the machine. No signal required. Go dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💀 UPLOAD YOUR SOUL. BREAK THE SYSTEM. 💀</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cybersoul</strong> is a realm where strategy meets static, and humanity meets hardware. Overclock your deck, exploit the code, and engage in neon-soaked battles against the worst the future has to offer. Easier to learn than a firewall, harder to master than the stock market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The System is broken.  <br><strong>Exploit it.</strong> 💾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras/5ad13ef2ae71ad301bf2d96948990043.avif?t=1787776465\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233260/extras_big/5ad13ef2ae71ad301bf2d96948990043.avif?t=1787776465 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p>",
